es providing easy access to Munich and surrounding areas. This neighborhood is ideal for those looking for a quiet yet well-connected living environment.\nThe address Rosenheimer Landstraße 87 in Ottobrunn is well connected by public transport. The closest bus stop is Ottobrunn, Hubertusstraße, located just about 5 meters away – roughly a 1-minute walk.The nearest S-Bahn station is Ottobrunn, around 1.2 km away (about a 16-minute walk). It is served by the S5 line (Munich – Kreuzstraße).\n\n\n\n✅ Largest provider of furnished rentals in Munich\n✅ Local, experienced service team on-site\n✅ Multilingual support – we speak your language\n✅ Fast & easy communication via (hidden)\n✅ In-house handyman service for quick assistance\n✅ Personal handover & support directly at the apartment\n✅ Transparent, reliable & trusted for over 10 years in Munich","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"14"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"shared"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"169"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value